:"2026-11-28T01:19:48+00:00","h":"matthewfairburn.bsky.social","o":"The Athletic","t":"31 seconds into the game, and the Sabres have a 1-0 lead. Jiri Kulich scores on a perfect pass from Rasmus Dahlin. Kulich's heater continues. ","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/matthewfairburn.bsky.social/post/3n3djwjwzik2w"},{"a":"Joe Yerdon","d":"2026-11-28T01:19:23+00:00","h":"joeyerdon.bsky.social","o":"Bleacher Report","t":"It took the Sabres 17 seconds to score last game. Tonight? 31 seconds. Dahlin sauces a pass to Kulich on the rush and he finishes it beautifully to stay blazing hot \n\n1-0 Sabres","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/joeyerdon.bsky.social/post/3n3djvsgg6226"},{"a":"Heather Engel","d":"2026-11-26T02:40:38+00:00","h":"engelheather.bsky.social","o":"NHL.com","t":"Final: Sabres win 5-1. \n\nRasmus Dahlin, Jiri Kulich, and Zach Benson each with a goal and an assist.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/engelheather.bsky.social/post/3n36njaagu22p"},{"a":"Joe Yerdon","d":"2026-11-26T01:25:42+00:00","h":"joeyerdon.bsky.social","o":"Bleacher Report","t":"Very funny to hear the crowd's reactions to Rasmus Dahlin's choices for this or that with thanksgiving foods.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/joeyerdon.bsky.social/post/3n36jdb2vgc2y"},{"a":"Joe Yerdon","d":"2026-11-26T01:11:50+00:00","h":"joeyerdon.bsky.social","o":"Bleacher Report","t":"Zach Benson getting in on the act now after Dahlin fires a rebound that Benson tips past Korpisalo to make it 3-0. \n\nRangers use their timeout after the goal and that was a good idea - this might get out of hand.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/joeyerdon.bsky.social/post/3n36ikh4tbs2y"},{"a":"Heather Engel","d":"2026-11-26T01:11:37+00:00","h":"engelheather.bsky.social","o":"NHL.com","t":"And just over 30 seconds later, it's 3-0.\n\nDahlin gets to a rebound above the slot, and Benson tips it in.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/engelheather.bsky.social/post/3n36ik3h5bk2g"},{"a":"Matthew Fairburn","d":"2026-11-26T01:11:31+00:00","h":"matthewfairburn.bsky.social","o":"The Athletic","t":"Sabres are rolling now. Zach Benson gets one. Deflected a Rasmus Dahlin shot. Buffalo up 3-0. ","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/matthewfairburn.bsky.social/post/3n36ijvh3t222"},{"a":"Matthew Fairburn","d":"2026-11-26T00:09:19+00:00","h":"matthewfairburn.bsky.social","o":"The Athletic","t":"Eric Wood got the crowd fired up on the drum before puck drop, and then the Sabres score 17 seconds into the game. Rasmus Dahlin. KeyBank Center is buzzing. ","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/matthewfairburn.bsky.social/post/3n36f2osowf24"}],"team":"BUF","threads":[],"videos":[{"d":"2026-11-26T03:40:11+00:00","id":"Fe0iEmn1PzM","k":"video","t":"\"We Are A Good Team And Eventually It Is Going To Click\" | Rasmus Dahlin on Win | Buffalo Sabres","team":"BUF","u":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fe0iEmn1PzM"},{"d":"2026-11-24T20:08:37+00:00","id":"MYAQyHWaOcM","k":"video","t":"“It Is Important For Us To Give Back” | Rasmus Dahlin on Thanksgiving Helping | Buffalo Sabres","team":"BUF","u":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MYAQyHWaOcM"},{"d":"2026-11-12T03:25:40+00:00","id":"2m2cD1eDHto","k":"video","t":"“The Stuff They Get Is Stuff We Can Control.” | Rasmus Dahlin | Buffalo Sabres","team":"BUF","u":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2m2cD1eDHto"},{"d":"2026-10-28T07:07:24+00:00","id":"3TFKnHWc7pU","k":"video","t":"“A Lot Of Sacrifice.” Rasmus Dahlin Emphasizes The Importance Of Blocked Shots | Buffalo Sabres","team":"BUF","u":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3TFKnHWc7pU"},{"d":"2026-10-25T04:21:59+00:00","id":"uhWlI06DqkE","k":"video","t":"“We Have To Play Better, That’s the Bottom Line.” | Rasmus Dahlin | Buffalo Sabres","team":"BUF","u":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uhWlI06DqkE"},{"d":"2026-10-19T17:33:10+00:00","id":"HQO1JynLRGk","k":"video","t":"“I Think I’ll Be Ready.” | Rasmus Dahlin on Returning To Play | Buffalo Sabres","team":"BUF","u":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HQO1JynLRGk"}]}